{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_03_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6eeeaebee62f8757b3db0812e9f3c6a460de34f377fd47f9f521b3e187c0a4fb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2434ef2ef2fcc0bed55b739cb8fa01199588020ab7a56f98eb71ccf8341b7176",
      "text": "（不知不觉间，就变成了会一起吃午饭、\n有什么事就一起去喝一杯的关系了呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59688ce4336cb9df8a5e56a52cf2a53e99a21a2a4c47817cd9f98b85d8587af5",
      "text": "Mr. 山下，sorry。聊得太入迷了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee1dbbcefa91e717cc594e4eb4f9c4d8db977bbcf8ac697221dc7dd0029d6198",
      "text": "……类你啊，不管什么时候看起来都很开心呢。\n当老师的时候也是，辞职的现在也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e70ae24ab6f790b38d92b10861cbd0a1cece1a56c13860e58ea67323220b47d3",
      "text": "嗯！嘛，虽然当教师的时候也很开心啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68d24dee881be73e07c8392112b96bc2e5e1448bd91893950582896da65c6f67",
      "text": "但三个人要是成了偶像，\n每天一定会变得更开心、更exciting哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1decb64814d1d2a7ff207084756eb5adbe667978c89eff63d1184c74fdffe5eb",
      "text": "这就意味着life会变得更加happy对吧？\n呵呵，我很期待成为偶像呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203037f3aabc032fbba70d52eef43b1c504698829689d40774de8d2f7c79dba4",
      "text": "好啦，Mr. 山下！差不多该向着重头戏的\n315 Production let's go了☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3f5cba1c3eb2d9d36d9c1c2228977b460a1ab0a4595af7db40a40dd2f3c9100",
      "text": "是啊，绕路就到此为止……\n哈！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4aa1d928c6883bb709739590171f01c32918e98229da5f488fbbfb568f0f3f2",
      "text": "好的，前几天真是太感谢了！\n之后我会寄资料给您的，可以的话下次也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4749d030006fad753dbc5451b85797bc47f19a28acb2962728f2152959cfbdf",
      "text": "（那、那个人……那个背影是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:195b89c64c4b7cad26f5b861b95b769e69236d6fc88ce03f5320bbbcd7658f14",
      "text": "（之前在赛马里猜中了大冷门的幸运儿！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
